# ALMONA Constitutional Development Rules

## CONSTITUTIONAL CONSTRAINTS (AICS-001)
1. NO ML/AI in execution paths (Tier 3)
2. ALL adaptive intelligence must use IntelligenceGate
3. Deterministic constraints are NON-NEGOTIABLE
4. Human validation required for all outputs

## DEVELOPMENT RULES
1. Check AICS-001 before implementing ANY feature
2. Use AlgorithmSelector.ts for ALL algorithm selection
3. Add constitutional tests to GuaranteeVerification.test.ts
4. Document ALL changes with AICS-001 section references

## FEATURE VERIFICATION COMMANDS
- /@agent verify AICS-001 [section] - Check implementation status
- /@agent analyze feature [name] - Analyze feature completeness
- /@agent check-constraints - Verify Tier 3 compliance

## FILES TO ALWAYS CHECK
1. src/lib/fabricator/AlgorithmSelector.ts
2. src/tests/constitutional/GuaranteeVerification.test.ts
3. src/lib/ydt/IntelligenceGate.ts
4. src/components/fabricator/drafting/DraftingWorkbench.tsx